      "writtenOn": "2022-12-14T06:57:44Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Not sending the packets to the emulator ports if IPv6 or IPv4 send succeeded seems a bit arbitrary, it would sometimes send packets there if there\u0027s some I/O error ? This doesn\u0027t match the condition used when supportMultipleSocketsDiscovery is false I think ? (where it sends it in any case).\n\nI think this can follow the same logic as the supportMultipleSocketsDiscovery\u003dfalse case, e.g. send it every time. This doesn\u0027t matter here as castShellEmulatorMdnsPorts is always empty for us anyway (MdnsConfigs.castShellEmulatorMdnsPorts() is hardcoded to an empty array)",
      "revId": "50bf00760ecec14d567f70d63d508baf52254147",
