      "writtenOn": "2022-12-15T08:55:37Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Oops, it\u0027s wrong logic here. It should be `!sendPacketToIpv4AndIpv6(requestSender, MdnsConstants.MDNS_PORT)` like `supportMultipleSocketsDiscovery \u003d false` case. In single socket case, `sendPacketTo()` would throw IOException and return null if sending packet failed. Then the emulator port won\u0027t be sent. We should do the same desing for multiple sockets case. So returns null if sending packet to IPv4 and IPv6 are both failed.\n\nBut as you said, it doesn\u0027t matter the result is \"half worked\" or \"fully worked\". So just not doing the check here maybe.",
