      "message": "Would this log an error every time on a v4-only network ? Could you avoid that by checking whether the socket has v4/v6 ?\n\nYou could check whether the socket has joined v4 or v6, and avoid sending if not.\n\nIf this is not called on the handler thread, you might have to make the joinedV4/v6 members volatile so at least the reads are consistent. It\u0027s going to be racy anyway as the address/interface could be gone by the time the packet gets sent, but at least it should avoid logging error messages most of the time.",
